            "Frames should either uniquely identify possible sample units (an element frame) or provide information about naturally occurring groups that can be used to identify unique sample units with additional sampling steps (a cluster frame).",
            "In the Netherlands a population register with detailed demographic and family information on all people in the country is available for drawing samples, while the United States has no such register and relies on other frames to identify sample units.",
